  Description: Prerequisite Region - Shining Kingdoms You follow the philosophy of
    the Prophecies of Kalistrade, seeking to build up your wealth in this life so
    that you might meet the next world on your own terms. Choose two attribute boosts.
    One must be to Constitution or Intelligence , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Kalistrade Lore skill. You gain
    the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Bargain Hunter] skill feat.
